# - Column 1 onwards: pipes from previous siblings that have pending subtrees
# 
# For the ROOT node (no prefix from above):
# Children are shown with:
# - First child: "├▷..." if not last, "└▷..." if last
# - Second child: "├▷│..." (the │ is from first child's pipe if first had subtrees)
# - Third child: "└▷││..." (both previous siblings' pipes if they had subtrees)
# 
# Actually, the pipe appears for a sibling if that sibling HAS CHILDREN (has pending subtree).
